WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
A synthetic order API is exposed
as MCP tools.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:09.000
The reader can list orders.
The API receives one GET.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:13.000
The gateway rejects the reader’s write.
The POST count stays at zero.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:17.000
The writer can create an order.
The POST count goes up to one.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:21.000
The assertions verify all three
results and the API counters.
